  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'A <b>software tech park</b> is an area for software development and export,
    often with a government-supported body like Software Technology Parks of India
    (STPI) that provides a single-window system for services. STPs are dedicated
    zones that support IT and software export services. They provide high-quality
    infrastructure, data communication facilities, and incubation support. STPs encourage
    software development, IT start-ups, and global outsourcing operations.

'
